Z||000006||vettepaul||03-21-2001||06:18 PM||||Hi Bob,thanks for the reply.I think the general opinion of these cars over here in the UK is nothing but JAW DROPPING.Most people thinkthat you must be rich or something as it costs me the equivelant of $90 US to fill the vettes tank with gas.Little do they know that I'm just more broke than everyone else.But hey,I love every minute of it! I can be next to a Porche or some other tuned up eurobox at the lights and nobody gives them a second look......Fantastic!   Cheers,Paul. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
